	<Property Name="NI.Lib.Description" Type="Str">The limit expression associated with the measure. The lower and higher limits will be extracted and stored in the datawarehouse for the reports that use limits.

1)  lower_bound &lt;= X &lt;= higher_bound
2)  lower_bound &lt; X &lt;= higher_bound
3)  lower_bound &lt;= X &lt; higher_bound
4)  lower_bound &lt; X &lt; higher_bound
5)  lower_bound &lt;= X
6)  lower_bound &lt; X
7)  X &lt;= higher_bound
8)  X &lt; higher_bound
9)  X == higher_bound
10) X != higher_bound
11) X &lt;= lower_bound OR higher_bound &lt;= X
12) X &lt; lower_bound OR higher_bound &lt;= X
13) X &lt;= lower_bound OR higher_bound &lt; X
14) X &lt; lower_bound OR higher_bound &lt; X
</Property>
